# every instrument of the demo song (Sunset Beach, imported from a VGM) plays from the keys on a
# channel of its kind from every column: its NOISE ones (1E-25, PSG instruments without a noise
# macro that the song uses only on NOI, the mode set by 20xy) on NOI, not as a tone on SQ1
wait 300
tap HOME
expect view 0
expect misrouted 0
expect ch 0
expect insch30 9
expect insch37 9
# on SQ1 too
turn ALGO 6
expect ch 6
expect insch30 9
# from the keys: NOISE E (1E) on NOI
turn PRESET 30
expect ins 30
key 0 down
wait 30
expect jamch 9
key 0 up
wait 800
expect hanging 0
# in edit mode it is not written into SQ1
tap REC
tapkey 0
tap REC
expect dirty 0
# on NOI it is written
turn ALGO 3
expect ch 9
tap REC
tapkey 0
tap REC
expect dirty 1
expect hanging 0
